--- !u!114 &1709852092
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1709852081}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 40fe67fde4a4351409089804b4848b92, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _documentationText: 'Object Detection DAMO-YOLO Example

    Real-time COCO object
    detection using DAMO-YOLO with optional Unity Sentis or OpenCV DNN frameworks.

    

    Demonstrates:

    -
    Reading input frames via MultiSourceToMatHelper (webcam, video file, image file,
    or GPU readback)

    - Loading DAMO-YOLO ONNX/Sentis model and class names
    from StreamingAssets

    - Toggling Sentis vs OpenCV DNN inference and async
    detection via MatSingleFlightSyncAsyncRunner

    - Converting RGBA frames to
    BGR, running DAMOYOLOObjectDetectorMultiBackend, and visualizing output Mat

    

    OpenCV
    classes and APIs used:

    - Mat, Size, Scalar, Point

    - Imgproc: cvtColor

    -
    DAMOYOLOObjectDetectorMultiBackend, MatSingleFlightSyncAsyncRunner, MultiBackendDnn

    -
    MultiSourceToMatHelper, OpenCVMatUnityUtils

    

    Referring to:

    https://github.com/tinyvision/DAMO-YOLO

    https://github.com/tinyvision/DAMO-YOLO/blob/master/tools/demo.py

    

    [Tested
    Models]

    damoyolo_tinynasL18_Ns.onnx https://idstcv.oss-cn-zhangjiakou.aliyuncs.com/DAMO-YOLO/release_model/onnx/before_distill/damoyolo_tinynasL18_Ns.onnx

    damoyolo_tinynasL18_Nm.onnx
    https://idstcv.oss-cn-zhangjiakou.aliyuncs.com/DAMO-YOLO/release_model/onnx/before_distill/damoyolo_tinynasL18_Nm.onnx

    damoyolo_tinynasL20_T_436.onnx
    https://idstcv.oss-cn-zhangjiakou.aliyuncs.com/DAMO-YOLO/release_model/onnx/damoyolo_tinynasL20_T_436.onnx'
  AlignmentSetting: 0
